Hello Jun

jr1. Yes. When using the controller path, AlterConfigOp.OpType.SET =
allows null values.=20
As a result, the user=E2=80=99s configuration may be deleted =
unintentionally.

Best Regards,
Jiunn-Yang

> Jun Rao via dev <dev@kafka.apache.org> =E6=96=BC 2026=E5=B9=B41=E6=9C=88=
