Hi everyone,

I am looking for feedback on *KIP-1267
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1267%3A+Tiered+Stora=
ge+Cost+Attribution+Metrics>*.
I=E2=80=99d appreciate it if anyone could take a look and share their thoug=
hts.

