>>> >>>>>>>>>>      - If the handler returns Result.RESUME, processing
>>> >> continues
>>> >>>>>> with the
>>> >>>>>>>>>> next record
>>> >>>>>>>>>>      - If the handler returns Result.FAIL, the exception
>>> >>> propagates
>>> >>>>>> (same
>>> >>>>>>>> as
>>> >>>>>>>>>> current behavior)
>>> >>>>>>>>>>      - If no handler is configured, behavior remains unchang=
ed
>>> >>>>>> (backward
>>> >>>>>>>>>> compatible)
