Mickael Maison created KAFKA-20123:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Use re2j for regex matching in Connect runtime
                 Key: KAFKA-20123
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20123
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: connect
            Reporter: Mickael Maison
            Assignee: Mickael Maison


The Connect runtime handles regex provided by external users. Re2j is less susceptible to malicious regex causing long computation time. 

Re2j is already a Kafka dependency as it's used in the coordinator logic.



