Hi Apoorv,
Thinking more about how to prevent arbitrary topics from being accidentally o=
r maliciously bombarded with DLQ records, I've added a topic-level config whi=
ch must be true in order for a topic to be used as a DLQ topic for share grou=
ps. If a DLQ topic is auto-created, of course the config will be set.

Let me know what you think.

Thanks,
Andrew

