John Mannooparambil created KAFKA-20164:
-------------------------------------------

             Summary: Add Kraft layer support for snapshots with metadata r=
ecords via new handeLoadBootstrap
                 Key: KAFKA-20164
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20164
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: John Mannooparambil
             Fix For: 4.3.0


KIP-1170 introduces uncommitted metadata records into the 0-0.checkpoint. C=
urrent invariants hold that handleLoadSnapshot should only be processing co=
mmitted records. In order to maintain this but also allow for the proper ha=
ndling of the new 0-0.checkpoint we need a new handleLoadBootstrap so that =
there is a distinction for Kraft applications between the handling of uncom=
mitted vs committed snapshots.=C2=A0



