> > I would like to start discussion of a new KIP for detecting and handling
> > misrouted connections from Kafka clients. The Kafka protocol does not
> > contain any information for working out when the broker metadata
> > information in a client is inconsistent or stale. This KIP proposes a way
> > to address this.
