Hi all,

I created RC0 yesterday, but afterwards a high and a critical CVE came up
during the docker builds. I have fixed those (jose4j and jersey version
bump), discarded that RC and am currently in the process of making a new
one. By today two issues surfaced, KAFKA-20168 (CVE) and KAFKA-20131 (bug),
so I'll tackle those and hopefully will be able to kick out the new RC.

Thanks,
Viktor

