Hello Jos=C3=A9,

Thanks you for your comments,

I have updated the Public Interfaces section to note that this KIP does =
not change any public interfaces,=20
and also revised the Proposed Changes section to describe the behavior =
changes instead of relying on code.

Best Regards,
Jiunn-Yang

