> > > > scheduling, and gives users full control over whether to send a lea=
ve
> > > > group request on closing.
> > > > * This release also delivers significant improvements to consistenc=
y
> > > > and observability: CLI tools now feature standardized arguments lik=
e
> > > > --bootstrap-server across all tools, metric naming has been correct=
ed
