Hi,

I'd like to start a vote on KIP-1239 which proposes to extend the
RemoteClusterUtils/MirrorClient APIs to translate the offsets of
multiple consumer groups at the same time.

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/h4HMFw

Let me know if you have any feedback.

Thanks,
Mickael

