Kirk True created KAFKA-20188:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Implement timeout/expiration for OffsetsRequestManager.fetchOffsets()
                 Key: KAFKA-20188
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20188
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: clients, consumer
    Affects Versions: 4.1.0, 4.0.0, 4.2.0
            Reporter: Kirk True
            Assignee: Kirk True


The implementation of {{fetchOffsets()}} does not currently take a timeout and it appears that it retries in an attempt to fetch all the offsets for the given partitions. In edge cases where one or more partitions continuously fails, this can cause repeated fetches until resolved.



--
