--000000000000240502064af8fd63
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi all,

I would like to start a vote on KIP-1263: Group Coordinator Assignment
Batching and Offload.

The KIP protects group coordinator stability and availability from
expensive assignment calculations triggered by clients. To achieve this, we
make a tradeoff in rebalance times, which may take up to 1 heartbeat longer
to settle.

KIP:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1263%3A+Group+Coordinator+Assignment+Batching+and+Offload
Discussion Thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/36b42c0c0o45gdnhp1yoqcl2j57bc5qq

Thanks,
Sean

--000000000000240502064af8fd63--

