> Hi all,
>
> I would like to start a vote on KIP-1263: Group Coordinator Assignment
> Batching and Offload.
>
> The KIP protects group coordinator stability and availability from
> expensive assignment calculations triggered by clients. To achieve this, =
we
> make a tradeoff in rebalance times, which may take up to 1 heartbeat long=
er
> to settle.
>
> KIP:
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1263%3A+Group+Coord=
inator+Assignment+Batching+and+Offload
