Subject: [DISCUSS] KIP-1285: DSL Opt-in Support for Header-Aware State Stores
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="000000000000fe6266064b178527"
From: "Alieh Saeedi via dev" <dev@kafka.apache.org>
