> > > > > >
> > > > > > 2) Dynamic configurations created before KIP-1030 cannot be appli=
ed
> > > > due to
> > > > > > validation errors.
> > > > > >
> > > > > > Personally, I believe users should be explicitly aware of breaking
> > > > > > changes. Therefore, I suggest forcing the broker to fail when
> > > > initializing
