A rough idea is that we could add a tagged field to the broker registration t=
o contain the static properties that have validators in their config definiti=
on. The goal is to empower the controller to do more validation before approv=
ing the upgrade

On 2026/02/17 19:28:08 Jun Rao via dev wrote:
