Dear all,

The Project Management Committee (PMC) for Apache Kafka is pleased to 
announce Lianet Magrans as a new PMC member.

Lianet has been a Kafka committer since August 2024. She has remained 
very active in the community since then, and it's my pleasure to 
announce that she has accepted our invitation to become a member of the 
Kafka PMC.

Congratulation Lianet!


Matthias, on behalf of the Apache Kafka PMC

