@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+---
+title: "Apache Kafka 3.9.2 Release Announcement"
+linkTitle: "AK 3.9.2"
+date: 2026-02-21
+author: "PoAn Yang"
+aliases:
+  - /blog/2026/02/21/apache-kafka-3-9-2-release-announcement/
