Hi all,

I wanted to send a friendly reminder about the vote for KIP-1247.

Currently, we have 1 non-binding +1 vote.

KIP link:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1247%3A+Make+Bytes+ut=
ils+class+part+of+the+public+API

This is a straightforward KIP that:

   - Makes only core Bytes methods officially public
   - Moves helper methods to the internals package
   - Has no compatibility impact on users

If you have any concerns or questions, please let me know. Otherwise, I
would appreciate your vote when you have a chance to review.

Thanks and best regards,

Siddhartha

