+1. I stumbled across the GitHub issue, leading me to this KIP.
With the downfall of the bitnami catalog, it has become more important than=
 ever, for there to be a officially supported helm chart for kafka.


On 2025/03/24 13:50:31 Stephen Askew wrote:
> Hi All,
>
> I've opened a new KIP-1149: Helm Chart for Apache Kafka<https://cwiki.apa=
che.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1149%3A+Helm+Chart+for+Apache+Kafka> w=
ith the proposal to have an official Helm chart to deploy Apache Kafka to K=
ubernetes.

>
> The initial Jira ticket (KAFKA-6416<https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse=
/KAFKA-6416>) requesting this was created back in 2018, but now that the pr=
oject has an official Docker container image it would now seem appropriate =
to have a matching Helm chart.

>
> There is a draft PR<https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/19249> in Github=
 with an initial stab at defining the solution for this.

>
> I look forward to seeing the discussion on this.
>
> Regards,
>
> Stephen.
