Hi all,

This KIP has been accepted, with 4 binding votes (David Jacot, Lucas
Brutschy, Andrew Schofield, Matthias Sax) and 1 non-binding (Kirk True)

Thanks,
Lianet

On Sun, Feb 22, 2026 at 3:58=E2=80=AFPM Matthias J. Sax <mjsax@apache.org> =
wrote:

> +1 (binding)
>
> On 2/17/26 5:23 PM, Kirk True wrote:
