> >>>> +1 (binding)
> >>>>
> >>>> Le mar. 17 f=C3=A9vr. 2026 =C3=A0 16:52, Lianet Magrans <lianetm@apa=
che.org> a
> =C3=A9crit :
> >>>>
> >>>>> Hi all,
> >>>>>
> >>>>> I would like to start a vote on KIP-1274 that proposes a path
> towards the
> >>>>> deprecation and removal of the Classic rebalance protocol in the
> >>>>> KafkaConsumer.
> >>>>>
> >>>>> The KIP proposes a phased long-term plan, starting with
> recommendations to
> >>>>> upgrade to the generally available Consumer protocol, and having th=
e
> main
> >>>>> deprecation and removal changes taking place in the next major
> releases.
> >>>>>
> >>>>> KIP:
> >>>>>
> >>>>>
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1274%3A+Deprecate+a=
nd+remove+support+for+Classic+rebalance+protocol+in+KafkaConsumer
> >>>>>
> >>>>> Discussion thread:
