Hi Alyssa,

RE AH1: Yeah, I will make the language more explicit.

RE AH2: I should have said "Prior to this KIP, starting kafka on any node
requires cluster.id to be present in meta.properties, otherwise the node
will crash. This means that clusters that upgrade to an MV that supports
this feature will have a cluster.id." Apologies for the confusion.

Best,
Kevin Wu

