Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

I am Hitesh Chawla, a Cloud Support Engineer at AWS specializing in Amazon
MSK. Over the last 4 years, I have focused on large-scale streaming
architecture, specifically addressing broker-side performance and partition
scalability for enterprise-grade clusters.
Having closely monitored the evolution of KRaft, I=E2=80=99ve requested my =
Jira and
Wiki IDs to begin contributing to Kafka Core. My primary interest lies in
improving Metadata stability and optimizing Controller performance to
ensure high-throughput reliability in ZooKeeper-less environments.
I look forward to collaborating with the PMC and community to drive the
roadmap for Kafka 4.x and beyond.

Regards,
Hitesh Chawla

--0000000000005d25e2064bc5b9c5--

